Extended xv6-riscv
==================

The MIT xv6-riscv teaching OS, extended with three feature sets built for
the Operating Systems course at Ben-Gurion University of the Negev:

  1. Cooperative coroutines + memsize    -> co_test, co_error_test,
                                            memsize_test, helloworld
  2. The "Israeli Lock" + PRNG           -> relay_race
  3. virtio-GPU framebuffer + graphics   -> show_flip, show_map, gol

Run with:   make qemu        (quit with Ctrl-a x)
            make qemu-web    (noVNC browser view of the GPU window)

See README.md for full documentation. Built on xv6-riscv (MIT PDOS),
MIT License (see LICENSE).

Authors: Wesam Gara, Nasr Assi
